  {%- if k == 'portal' -%}PlayStation, PS5, PlayStation Portal and DualSense are trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment. SEVENCRUSH is an independent retailer, not affiliated with Sony.
  {%- else -%}Nintendo Switch 2, Joy-Con, Mario Kart and Pokémon are trademarks of their owners. SEVENCRUSH is an independent retailer, not affiliated with Nintendo.{%- endif -%}
  Original prices are the maker's US list prices (MSRP).
</p>

{%- comment -%} ───────────── Sticky bar, toast, lightbox ───────────── {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="bfx-bar" data-bfx-bar aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="bfx-bar__img"><img data-bfx-barimg alt="" src="{{ hero_img | image_url: width: 120 }}"></span>
  <span class="bfx-bar__t"><b>{{ name_a }} {{ name_b }}</b><small><span data-bfx-barv>{{ cur.title }}</span> · <s data-bfx-barwas>{{ cur.compare_at_price | money }}</s></small></span>
  <button type="button" class="bfx-cta bfx-cta--sm" data-bfx-baradd tabindex="-1">Add · <span data-bfx-barp>{{ cur.price | money }}</span></button>
</div>
